{"msg_id":"m0003","ts":1788190701,"sender_uid":"u1001","sender_name":"示例用户A","text":"早上八点地铁口集合吧，我带点水和面包。","at_uids":[],"reply_to_msg_id":null,"media":[]}
{"msg_id":"m0004","ts":1788190733,"sender_uid":"u1003","sender_name":"示例用户C","text":"爬山我就不去了，膝盖不太行。你们晚上吃啥？","at_uids":[],"reply_to_msg_id":null,"media":[]}
